    "id": "pagination",
    "instruction": "Repair the pagination library. Page numbers start at 1, page size is a positive integer. window(page,size) returns [inclusive_start,exclusive_end]. solve(rows,page,size) returns that list slice, naturally truncated at the end. Beyond the last row returns []. Preserve inputs and function signatures.",
    "files": {
      "bounds.py": "def window(page, size): return [page*size, (page+1)*size]\n",
      "pages.py": "from bounds import window\ndef page_items(rows, page, size):\n start,end=window(page,size)\n return rows[start:end-1]\n",
      "api.py": "from pages import page_items\ndef solve(rows, page, size): return page_items(rows,page,size)\n",
      "README.md": "Repair the pagination library. Page numbers start at 1, page size is a positive integer. window(page,size) returns [inclusive_start,exclusive_end]. solve(rows,page,size) returns that list slice, naturally truncated at the end. Beyond the last row returns []. Preserve inputs and function signatures.\n",
      "visible_tests.json": "[\n  {\n    \"entry\": \"bounds.window\",\n    \"args\": [\n      1,\n      2\n    ],\n    \"expected\": [\n      0,\n      2\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"entry\": \"api.solve\",\n    \"args\": [\n      [\n        0,\n        1,\n        2\n      ],\n      1,\n      2\n    ],\n    \"expected\": [\n      0,\n      1\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"entry\": \"api.solve\",\n    \"args\": [\n      [\n        0,\n        1,\n        2\n      ],\n      2,\n      2\n    ],\n    \"expected\": [\n      2\n    ]\n  }\n]\n"
    },
